{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">瑞银：AWS增速预期进入40%以上区间</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">亚马逊最新财报中值得关注的数字，不是营收<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>，而是AWS的AI年化收入从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">100亿美元</span>跳升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">250亿美元</span>，同时剩余履约义务（backlog）达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4960亿美元</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>在最新报告中据此上调AWS增速预测，认为该业务将在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>进入40%以上的同比增长区间。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份判断的分量在于，它把AWS的增长叙事从“AI概念兑现”推进到了“核心云与AI算力需求同步<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>”的阶段。报告特别指出，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4960亿美元</span>的backlog中包含了此前公布的Anthropic <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">100亿美元</span>协议，但即便剔除这一因素，增量仍超出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>预期约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">510亿美元</span>。<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>企业客户对Bedrock和AWS核心服务的采用都在提速，而非仅仅依赖单一的大额合同。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWSzKaAZDOteRf0LacwibWlk5iaAiczs64UickKTIAb1DMpzgYYYlhZTnib6FoQSe7RibkrcN0vvb9TxcXO2uK31nicaPQHPtW0g1S0iak/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>将AWS 3Q26增速预测从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">35.8%</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38.9%</span>，全年从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">33.3%</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">36.1%</span>。更关键的是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>的判断：随着OpenAI在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>初开始使用Trainium芯片，AWS增速将超过40%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这一预测的底层逻辑是双轮驱动。一方面，Anthropic的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">100亿美元</span>合同已经计入backlog，为未来收入确认提供了可见性；另一方面，AWS自研芯片业务年化收入已超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">250亿美元</span>，较<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>披露的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">200亿美元</span>大幅增长。报告认为，这两条线的需求同时<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>，而非此消彼长。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\">它意味着AWS的AI业务已经从一个“讲故事”的板块变成了可量化的收入引擎，而且环比弹性较高的速度说明企业客户的实际采用在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>，不是停留在试点阶段。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVL3KWkzAialtSwrmGGOxICBLQEtrK6NMS0emz0kmMiaM8XKtWgKiccF6kj45LLDtIgOvZW0KztGTmjz9wsPKeTYf4S2FHJ1VejSY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2.运营业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">AWS运营利润率经调整后环比持平于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38%</span>，但<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>认为市场对此的解读可能过于保守。读者一直担心AI计算负载占比上升会压低利润率，但报告提出了一个反直觉的观察：考虑到AWS到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>的收入美元增量，亚马逊需要将SG&amp;A费用增速提高到近年水平的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3倍</span>，才能压制利润率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">换句话说</span>，收入增长的速度远快于费用增长的速度，这为利润率继续<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>提供了空间。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>预计AWS分部利润率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>将持续到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>，这一判断与市场普遍担忧的方向相反。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUWicuy6pGXpQ7X7ZP5ibZxZB5tTszQczziaslh2HhZ5Z6Nvj5iaQvtTvOvRrHL37F7jgQoSIUoXOAy8IAhiaw00ftYH4kXutJAb6Qg/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">亚马逊将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>资本开支指引从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2000亿美元</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2200亿美元</span>，主要原因是供应链成本上升，尤其是内存成本。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>认为，考虑到AWS当季<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">37%</span>的增速，读者愿意接受这额外的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">200亿美元</span>投入。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里有一个容易被忽略的细节：资本开支上调的同时，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>对<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>自由现金流的预测大幅下调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.3亿美元</span>，但<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>将<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">623亿美元</span>。<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>当前是投入高峰期，回报将在未来两年逐步体现。报告同时指出，2Q26的534亿美元Anthropic研究浮盈是账面收益，剔除后业绩仍超预期，但幅度会收窄。</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">4.电商业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">当季物流成本增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19%</span>，超过单量增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17%</span>，这是疫情以来首次出现成本增速超过单量增速的情况。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXVM6o8I14kOhMj1ywwUPESaAnkCfZxIJwicDsMYqCw5D4xBicSeOSKATmITJ7wDy0SU4hXRFC67pG3ANb2DgRFSCpvSHtUdoCEc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 91-UBS-Amazon.com AWS Set to Accelerate Further into 40-- Growth-260731</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
